From b46230c75dfb5c6eab8b687f85af69c7c5abbb85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 05:26:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Endgame step 1: King's Crown, class armor, armor abilities,
 Endure

The King of Dwarves drops the King's Crown. Wearing it opens a choice of
the class's three armor abilities (unported ones shown but disabled) and
turns the worn armor into class armor that keeps its stats and charges
over time. The Warrior's Endure is the first working ability.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HSv61cKy2EyUYHM43X2XFG
